  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Power Consumption:</strong> 1</p><p>If the <strong>Grapple Gun</strong> deals <strong>Damage</strong>, you can use a <strong>Free Action</strong> to cause the cable to recoil. You can choose to be pulled adjacent to the target, or you can try to pull the target to you.</p><p>If you try to pull the target to you, you must make an opposed <strong>Body (Athletics)</strong> check.</p><p>If you succeed, the target is pulled adjacent to you and is <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>If you fail, you are pulled to be adjacent to the target and are <strong>Prone</strong>.</p>",
